    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Hi, I&rsquo;m Vinay.</p>
    <p>I grew up outside of Portland, Oregon and remain a lifelong Trail Blazers basketball fan. I studied computer science and economics at Harvard. I&rsquo;ve spent my adult life living between San Francisco and New York City.</p>
    <p>These days, I&rsquo;m building <a href="https://www.anansi.capital/">Anansi Capital</a>, a new investment firm focused on transforming backbone industries with AI. Before that, I was a venture capital investor and was lucky to work with some amazing founders and businesses.</p>
    <p>I write about the intersection of technology, investing, and policy &mdash; this blog is where I work out ideas that excite me, in the hope that some of them land for you too. Reach out anytime with questions or thoughts. I love connecting with new people.</p>
